 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Use language learning apps, they have virtual partners and games. Record yourself and listen back. Talk to yourself in the mirror. Maybe at first. Keep it short and don't worry about what others think. Just focus on your language learning. Record yourself reading a story or reciting a list and listen back slowly. That's normal. Start with short chunks and build up. The more you do it, the less weird it feels. Honestly. Keep it fun and you' get used to it. Try reading a short story in Italian and then watching the English version. It' a fun way to compare.",
